              "value": "Output the following message:\nSearch Criteria too broad for Deleting Reservations. Please specify the Reservation Id or Demand Source Header Number for a demand document to go forward with deleting the reservations. Current pQuery: ` {{$context.$nodes.MA_FETCH_RESERVATIONS_QUERY_GENERATOR.$output.result}} `\nuserQuery: ` {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} `"
