        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "MA IMR Input extractor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1762194254824"
          },
          "code": "MA_IMR_INPUT_EXTRACTOR",
          "id": "1762204592264",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762204592265_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract the user input from the following: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.userQuery}} \nIf the Reservation Id related information is present extract it into the output ReservationId (reservation id is the reservation identifier Ex: Reservation id 123, rsv id).\nIf the RequirementDate related information is present extract it into the output RequirementDate. Use the current date: {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} as reference to deduce the date for RequirementDate if not explicitly mentioned. E.g. If past due date is mentioned you can assign current date as the RequirementDate, any relative mention of date should be deduced from current date.\nIf demand document related data is present then extract the DemandSourceType and DemandSourceTypeId refer below.\n  | DOCUMENT TYPE | DEMAND SOURCE TYPE    | DEMAND SOURCE TYPE ID |  \n            | ------------- | --------------------- | --------------------- |  \n            | Demand        | Sales order           | 2                     |  \n            | Demand        | Transfer order        | 8                     |  \n            | Demand        | Transfer order return | 18                    |  \n            | Demand        | Work order            | 5                     |  \n            | Demand        | Purchase order        | 1                     |  \n            | Demand        | Account               | 3                     |  \n            | Demand        | Account alias         | 6                     |  \n            | Demand        | Cycle count           | 9                     |  \n            | Demand        | User defined          | 13                    |\nIf document header number (that usually succeeds demand type) related data is present extract it into the `DemandSourceHeaderNumber` output (Ex: Sales order 123, Transfer order 123, etc).\nIf order number related data is present then extract it into \"DemandSourceHeaderNumber\" output.\nIf the reservation quantity related data is present extract it into the output ReservationQuantity.\nIf the intention is to search reservations that are running late (supply is running late), set the variable FindRunningLateReservations to true otherwise, set the variable to false. If the query is for past due recommendations then the variable is set to false."
            },
            {
              "id": "1762204592266_2",
              "name": "temperature",
              "type": "number",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"PastDue\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"FindRunningLateReservations\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"RequirementDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"DemandSourceType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"DemandSourceTypeId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"DemandSourceHeaderNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
