          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_UPDATE_ATTRIBUTES",
          "id": "1772649717795",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772649717797_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the following user query: `{{$context.$variables.userQuery}}`. Extract and set the following variables: \nShipToPartyId\nSubinventoryId\nSubinventoryCode\nRequirementDate\nLocatorId\nLocator\nLotNumber,\nPrimaryReservationQuantity\nSecondaryReservationQuantity\nRevision\nReservationQuantity\nPickQuantity\nReservationUOMCode (identify this value by a unit of measure code or abbreviation Ex: Ea)\nReservationUnitOfMeasure (identify this value by a unit of measure defined in a word Ex: Each)\nSupplySourceHeaderNumber (only when supply source type is different than on hand)\nSupplySourceLineNumber (only when supply source type is different than on hand)\nSupplySourceHeaderId (only when supply source type is different than on hand)\nSupplySourceLineId (only when supply source type is different than on hand)\nIf supply document related data is present then extract and set  the `SupplySourceType` and `SupplySourceTypeId` variables, refer below.\n  | SUPPLY TYPE | SUPPLY SOURCE TYPE    | SUPPLY SOURCE TYPE ID |  \n            | ------------| --------------------- | --------------------- |  \n            | Supply        | Purchase order        | 1                     |  \n            | Supply        | On hand        | 13                     |  \n            | Supply        | Requisition               | 17                    |  \n            | Supply        | Transfer order return | 18                    |  \n            | Supply        | Work order            | 5                     |  \n            | Supply        | Transfer order        | 8                     |  \nIf the intention is to update/change/move the supply source set the variable `UpdateSupply` as true; otherwise, set the value as false and extract the value for the following variables:\nSupplyTaskNumber\nSupplyTaskId\nSupplyProjectNumber\nSupplyProjectId"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"SupplyProjectId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"SupplyProjectNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SupplyTaskId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"SupplyTaskNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SupplySourceTypeId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"UpdateSupply\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"SupplySourceLineId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"SupplySourceHeaderId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"SupplySourceLineNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SupplySourceHeaderNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationUOMCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"Revision\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationUnitOfMeasure\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PickQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"SecondaryReservationQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"PrimaryReservationQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"LotNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"Locator\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"LocatorId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"RequirementDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"SubinventoryCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SubinventoryId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"ShipToPartyId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
