          "metadata": {
            "name": "Fitler Suggestions",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const suggestions = JSON.parse($context.$nodes.SUPPLY_SUGGESTIONS.$output.output);\nconst filteredSuggestions = suggestions.filter(suggestion => suggestion.Suggestion !== \"No eligible supply\");\nreturn filteredSuggestions;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1763160631956"
          },
          "code": "FITLER_SUGGESTIONS",
          "id": "1773426982887",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summarize output"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773374549932"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE_OUTPUT",
          "id": "1773430170002",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773430170002_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Old data: ` {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.userQuery}}`  \nNew data: `{{$context.$nodes.ITERATE_UPDATE_BULK_REQUEST.$output}}`\n\nFrom **New data**, select only **successful reservation updates**. Produce HTML output using the templates below:\n\n<!-- OUTPUT (return ONLY what’s in this section: the table(s) + Changes section; no extra text) -->\n\n<!-- Non-onhand supply cases table (Supply Source Type ID != 13) -->\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Reservation Id</th>\n      <th>Supply Source Type</th>\n      <th>Supply Source Header</th>\n      <th>Supply Source Line</th>\n      <th>Reservation Quantity</th>\n      <th>UOM</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <!-- Repeat this <tr> for each SUCCESSFUL reservation update where SupplySourceTypeId != 13 -->\n    <tr>\n      <td>{ReservationId}</td>\n      <td>{SupplySourceTypeName}</td>\n      <td>{SupplySourceHeaderNumber}</td>\n      <td>{SupplySourceLineNumber}</td>\n      <td>{ReservationQuantity}</td>\n      <td>{UOM}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br/>\n\n<!-- Changes section: list the exact update done for each item, concisely, comparing Old data vs New data -->\n<h3>Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n  <!-- Repeat one <li> per row included in the table(s) -->\n  <li>\n    Reservation {ReservationId}:  {Describe the changes only if one or some of the fields were updated: SupplySourceType, ReservationQuantity old -> new. Keep this concise}\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- Onhand supply cases table (Supply Source Type ID == 13) -->\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Reservation Id</th>\n      <th>Supply Source Type</th>\n      <th>Reservation Quantity</th>\n      <th>UOM</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <!-- Repeat this <tr> for each SUCCESSFUL reservation update where SupplySourceTypeId == 13 -->\n    <tr>\n      <td>{ReservationId}</td>\n      <td>{SupplySourceTypeName}</td>\n      <td>{ReservationQuantity}</td>\n      <td>{UOM}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br/>\n\n<!-- Changes section: list the exact update done for each item, concisely, comparing Old data vs New data -->\n<h3>Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n  <!-- Repeat one <li> per row included in the table(s) -->\n  <li>\n    Reservation {ReservationId}: {Describe the changes only if one or some of the fields were updated: SupplySourceType, ReservationQuantity old -> new. Keep this concise}\n  </li>\n</ul>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Adapt Update Output",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const response = $context?.$nodes?.ITERATE_UPDATE_BULK_REQUEST?.$output;\n\nconst lines = Array.isArray(response) ? response : [];\n\nconst result = lines\n  .map((line) => {\n    try {\n      const rsv = typeof line === \"string\" ? JSON.parse(line) : line;\nif (rsv.title = \"Bad Request\")\nreturn rsv.status;\nelse\n      return {\n        ReservationId: rsv?.ReservationId,\n        SupplySourceTypeId: rsv?.SupplySourceTypeId,\n        ReservationQuantity: rsv?.ReservationQuantity,\n        UOM: rsv?.PrimaryUnitOfMeasure\n      };\n    } catch {\n      return null; // or throw if you want to fail fast\n    }\n  })\n  .filter(Boolean);\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773430170002"
          },
          "code": "ADAPT_UPDATE_OUTPUT",
          "id": "1773434871710",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
